---
description: Node/TS library conventions — API design, exports, dependencies
globs: ["src/**/*.ts"]
---
Public API rules for this package:
- Only `src/index.ts` exports are public; everything else is internal by default.
- Named exports only. No default exports.
- Explicit return types on exported functions; `strict` + `noUncheckedIndexedAccess`.
- No `any`; narrow `unknown` at boundaries. `@ts-expect-error` needs a reason comment.
- Zero runtime dependencies by default; adding one needs justification + human approval.
- No side effects at import time (no env/config reads, no singletons); inject clock, fs, randomness.
- Breaking API changes require an ADR and a major version bump.
